# AI ERP System TestSprite PRD

Frontend base URL: http://187.127.165.219:5173
Backend base URL: http://187.127.165.219:8000
OpenAPI spec: http://187.127.165.219:8000/openapi.json

The app is a Paper Cup Factory SaaS with authenticated factory-scoped workflows for onboarding, inventory variation tracking, daily production entries, sales invoices, automatic stock deduction, pending payment dues, and reminder automation.

Critical flows:
- Login must allow a valid test user without trial-expiration blocking.
- Inventory GET must serialize old rows with null variation fields safely.
- Final stock onboarding must accept packaging variation fields.
- Production entry must add stock for a specific product and packaging variation.
- Sales invoice/order approval must deduct stock for the selected variation and reject insufficient stock.
- Pending dues API must return Unpaid and Half-Paid invoices with customer details.
- Reminder trigger must post pending dues to the n8n webhook route and return a structured result.
